[D#]Iss Mohabbat ka [G#]harjana kis [A#]tarah bharu Mai [D#]n

Khaa [G#]mosh Reh kar bhi [A#]keh Gaye

[G]Dariya sa dil tak [Cm]beh Gaye

[G#]Tum par ho raha hai [Fm] poora [A#] Aitbaar

[D#]Tum hi ho hifaazat [G#] meri Suno

[A#]Ye kaha hai Rooh ne [D#]eee

[D#]Kis tarah se [G#]shukar tera ab [A#]ada karu Mai [D#]n

[D#]Ishq ka bas naam Liya

Maine [G#] samjha nahi tha [D#]isey

[D#]Tune sikhaaya ki ye hai Ibaadat

[G#]Rooh ki bhaasha hai [A#]yeh

Teri [G#] badolat paayi woh [A#] Daulat

Jo [Fm] mili na mujhko [D#] Kahin

[G#]Jazbaat hadd se [A#]badhne Lage

[G]Dene lage [Cm] sadaa Tujhe

Har [G#] pal hai zaroori [Fm]ab tera [A#] Deedar

[D#]Kis tarah se [G#]shukar tera ab [A#]ada karu Mai [D#]n

[D#]Iss mohabbat ka [G#]harjana kis [A#]tarah bharu Mai [D#]n

Aisa [A#] kabhi dekha [G#] Nahi

Na [Fm]kabhi bhi kahin [D#] Suna

Dene [A#]wala sab dekar [G#] bhi keh [Fm] raha hai [D#] Shukriya

[G#]Tune hi toh [A#] samjha Mujhe

Jo na [G]keh saka main, [Cm]suna Tumhe

